          "observableDe": "Den fehlenden positivenCO2-Breakeven mathematisch erklären.",
          "observableEn": "Mathematically justify absence of positive-distance carbon break-even.",
          "evidenceBoundary": "Actual independent learner reasoning remains unobserved; answer key alone is not evidence."
        },
        {
