          "observableDe": "Kosten- undCO2-Richtung quellenkritisch getrennt abwägen.",
          "observableEn": "Critically weigh opposite cost/carbon results separately.",
          "evidenceBoundary": "Actual independent learner reasoning remains unobserved; answer key alone is not evidence."
